  "description": "Distributed rendering via Blender CLI and ffmpeg for .blend scene blobs, bootstrap typed-scene inputs, stills, tiled stills with overlap-aware tile options, runtime diagnostics, unified/frame/video/tiled preflight validation, frame sequences, and MP4 output. Persistent-batch distribution renders a node's whole chunk of frames/tiles in a single Blender process (scene loaded once) with per-engine chunk sizing.",
